# CR 723: Time Stop in Beginning of Combat ends the turn. EndTurn exiles the
# whole stack zone (endturneffect.go exileStack), Time Stop itself included,
# though it goes on resolving (EndTurnEffect.java:36-43, CR 723.1b); combat
# ends and the turn jumps to Cleanup. human's hand already fits and nothing triggers, so the
# Cleanup grants no priority and Step stops there (CR 514.3). The mana is
# tapped inside the step's own priority round: floating mana empties between
# steps (CR 500.4).
startturn human
advance 3
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue action human tapformana 11 U
queue action human tapformana 12 U
queue action human tapformana 13 U
queue action human tapformana 14 U
queue action human tapformana 15 U
queue action human tapformana 16 U
queue action human cast 1
step
